.TH KINTSUGI-DOCTOR 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-doctor \- environment readiness check
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi doctor
[\-\-net]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check environment readiness. Verifies configuration, providers, models, and
workspace state.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-net\fR
Probe the default provider endpoint
.SH EXAMPLES
Basic check:
.PP
  $ kintsugi doctor
.PP
With network probe:
.PP
  $ kintsugi doctor --net
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-connect (1)
